Key:
Adds asymmetric overscan to the camera.

@param InCameraComponent - The camera to add overscan to
@param InAsymmetricOverscan - The amount of asymmetric overscan to apply, from 0.0 meaning no overscan to 1.0 meaning 100% overscan. By convention,
                                                              X is the left overscan, Y is the right overscan, Z is the top overscan, and W is the bottom overscan.
     @param bScaleResolution - Indicates if the render resolution should be scaled up so that the original frustum of the camera remains the same resolution

Value:
为摄像机添加非对称过扫描。

@param InCameraComponent 要添加过扫描的摄像机
@param InAsymmetricOverscan 非对称过扫描量，0.0表示无过扫描，1.0表示100%过扫描。按照约定，
X为左侧，Y为右侧，Z为顶部，W为底部。
@param bScaleResolution 是否提高渲染分辨率，使摄像机原始视锥区域保持原有分辨率

